--------------------- CableDyn Input File ------------------------------------
CableDyn driver deck -- dynamic run: chain with a held fairlead (still-water fixed point), 10 s
-- Exercises the EI=0 dynamic path (generalised-alpha with BA damping, added mass, seabed spring +
-- normal damping). The Coupled fairlead is held at its deck position with no motionFile, so the
-- at-rest static equilibrium is a fixed point: tensions hold steady at the static values through
-- the 10 s march. Same chain/geometry as the WD0050 L2 parity reference (studless chain, 50 m depth).
